See what time it is for someone else. Read out a code, they type it in, and their time joins your world clock list and your home-screen widget — their timezone, or the ship they are on. Tap their row and their part of the world lights up. Only the time is ever shared, never where you are: not your position, not even your town. Either of you can stop it at any moment, or delete everything at once. Follow up to five people, free.
